                <pb facs="0477" n="365" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg365"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Dawson to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bogota</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1909-02-23"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">February 23,
                    1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The treaties passed reading to-day. The proceedings public. The treaties now are
                    before a special committee. No unfavorable developments so far.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dawson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
